  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Not applicable.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Uberaba Agua Viva Project is to promote better living conditions for all residents of the municipality through the promotion of integrated urban sanitation, environmental preservation, and expanded parks, recreational and cultural opportunities. There are 3 key components to the project: 1) Environmental Sanitation Investments, which includes waste water collection and treatment, urban drainage and water supply; 2) Environmental and Cultural Preservation and Recovery, which consists of natural resource preservation, environmental recovery, extending public recreational opportunities, expansion; and 3) Municipal Planning and Management which will improve the capacity of municipal government with a focus on governance of the municipal water company, environmental education, and strengthen the municipal environmental secretariat of research and tourist opportunities associated with the municipality&apos;s rich fossil deposits.</narrative>
  </description>
